{"4505360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mass Edge - Gravity Ball", "steam_appid": 4505360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mass Edge is a vibrant 3D puzzle-platformer that challenges your perception of movement, space, and timing. Built around a unique physics-based rolling mechanic, players must navigate intricate 3D environments by carefully controlling momentum, balance, and spatial awareness. Every turn, slope, and edge demands precision — as gravity can shift direction depending on the surface you roll onto.<br><br>Players guide their sphere across floating structures suspended in the sky, collecting diamonds to unlock new worlds and progress through over 90 handcrafted levels. With its signature dual-ball system, players can instantly switch between two different spheres — each with distinct properties and uses — to solve puzzles and reach hidden paths.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mass Edge is a vibrant 3D puzzle-platformer that challenges your perception of movement, space, and timing. Built around a unique physics-based rolling mechanic, players must navigate intricate 3D environments by carefully controlling momentum, balance, and spatial awareness. Every turn, slope, and edge demands precision — as gravity can shift direction depending on the surface you roll onto.<br><br>Players guide their sphere across floating structures suspended in the sky, collecting diamonds to unlock new worlds and progress through over 90 handcrafted levels. With its signature dual-ball system, players can instantly switch between two different spheres — each with distinct properties and uses — to solve puzzles and reach hidden paths.</p>", "short_description": "Mass Edge is a vibrant 3D puzzle-platformer that challenges your perception of movement, space, and timing. Built around a unique physics-based rolling mechanic, players must navigate intr